:history

    0.13.0.182-dev - 2026/05/31 (4f5eef7b) [fix/mcp-tool-binding-test-isolation]
        :brief PaperCode 换壳与本机 oh-my-opencode 表面素材迁入
        :brand
            - feat(brand): TUI 标题、终端标题、logo、错误页、提示语、preview 标题和公开测试期望统一为 PaperCode
            - feat(cli): 新增 papercode bin 入口与根目录 papercode 可执行文件链接，同时保留 papercode 兼容入口
            - docs(surface): README、开发手册、能力包、内置 agent 和 skill 文案同步 PaperCode 表面品牌
        :skills
            - feat(skills): 参考 oh-my-opencode 本机快照新增 PaperCode change review、security research、workflow skill
            - feat(agents): 新增 papercode reviewer、planner、researcher agent，并将 triage/issue/ai-deps 命令换成 PaperCode 语义
            - docs(notice): NOTICE 记录 oh-my-opencode 来源、版本、SUL-1.0 许可边界和改造文件范围
        :changelog
            - docs(changelog): README 当前版本同步到 0.13.0.182-dev
            - docs(changelog): 0.13.0.181 开发历史移入 docs/changelog/v0/0.13.0.181.CHANGELOG
            - docs(changelog): root CHANGELOG 活跃区仅保留当前 PaperCode 换壳条目
        :checks
            - targeted public surface tests: npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/cli/public-surface.test.ts test/cli/tui/paper-visible-commands.test.ts test/session/prompt-brand.test.ts --timeout 60000 passed
            - tui/init layout tests: npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/cli/tui/paper-terminal-utils.test.ts test/cli/tui/paper-models-layout.test.ts test/init/init.test.ts --timeout 60000 passed
            - preview tests: npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/preview test passed
            - typecheck: npx --yes bun@1.3.13 run --cwd packages/opencode typecheck passed
            - readme version: powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\check-readme-version.ps1 passed
            - changelog format: powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\check-changelog-format.ps1 -IncludeArchives passed
            - whitespace: git diff --check passed
